{
    "_comment": [
        "Phase 0 of the second evaluation round (PLAN_EWALUACJI_v2 section 3): the CANDIDATE",
        "scenes, not the chosen set. The chosen six are picked from this list by the user",
        "after seeing the lit-voxel share and the irradiance screenshots.",
        "",
        "  python tools/scenes.py configs      (one headless config per candidate)",
        "  python tools/scenes.py probe        (lit/occupied voxel census at every grid rung)",
        "  python tools/scenes.py irradiance   (BufferDebugView::VoxelIrradiance per candidate)",
        "  python tools/scenes.py report       (one table + scenes.json)",
        "",
        "'exposure', 'contrast' and 'saturation' are the tone settings the USER authored in",
        "the GUI on 2026-09-02 and are frozen: they decide what the image looks like and so",
        "what every FLIP number means. They are not free parameters.",
        "",
        "'bounces: 1' is the ENGINE's spelling, counting bounces after the shading point.",
        "In the thesis' own convention that is two bounces. Do not renumber it here.",
        "",
        "sun-temple appears twice because the user authored two camera states for it; both",
        "are candidates and at most one can enter the chosen set."
    ],
